<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 Timothi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timothi</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timothi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pathian thupiak bang a i hondampa leh i lamet Toupa Jesu Khrist sawltak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ginna a ka ta taktak Timothi kiang ah: Pathian, i Pa leh, Khrist Jesu, i Toupa kiang a kipan hehpihna, zahngaihna, khamuanna na tung ah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Masidonia gam a ka hohdek lai a k’on nget bang in Ephesa khua ah om gige in, huchi a mi khenkhat gindan tuam sinsaklou ding a na hilh theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan Pathian lam a phattuamna, ginna a o pen hilou, kiselna leh gintakthu gen omsak lel tangthu leh khangthu suizohlouh peuh buaipihlou ding a na hilh theihna ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eite’n thuhilh ding i kep pen bel lungtang siangthou leh sialehpha theihna siang leh ginna taktak a kipan a pawt itna ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi khenkhatte’n hiaite pialsan in thuginalou genna lam ah a vakmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thugen uh leh thil ahi a a gente u leng bang ahia chih theiloupi in dan sinsakmite hih a ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Min a zat hoih leh Dan a hoih chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi a, dan zaw mi diktatte ading a bawl ahi kei a, dan kalhte leh danlou a omte ading, Pathian limsakloute leh mikhialte, mi siangthouloute leh Pathian zahloute, pate thatte, nute thatte, mihing thatte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kingaihhatte, tawkawhukte, mihing gute, zuautheite, kichiam khemkhemte ading leh thil dang thugin toh kituaklou himhim te ading leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kiang a kepsak a om Pathian Tanchinhoih thupi hilhna dik kalhte ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hon hihhatpa Khrist Jesu i Toupa kiang ah kipahthu ka gen hi, muanhuai a honsaka, a nasempa dia a honchih tak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuma lam in Pathian gensepa leh sawipa leh hihsepa na hita mah leng; gingtaloupi leh theilou a hih ka hih ziak in ahi zahngaihna ka na muh tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan i Toupa hehpihna ginna leh Khrist Jesu a itna in nakpitak in a dimletta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrist Jesu khialte hondam ding in khovel ah a hongpai chih a taksanhuai in a laktuak mahmah hi. A lak ua khialpen ka hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh hiaiziakin ahi zahngaihna ka na muh: Jesu Khrist in a dohzohna kim a khialpen keimah a a latsak theihna ding ahi, tuban siah tangtawn hinna muhna ding a Amah hon gingta dingte adia etsakna hi ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa tangtawn a om, sitheilou, muhtheihlouh, Pathian tak kia, tangtawn a zahtak leh thupi in om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tapa Timothi aw, na tungtang genkholhnate toh kituakin hiai mohpuakna leh thuhilhna konpia hi, huchi a huai thute hilh a, kidouna hoih na dou theihna ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ginna leh sialehpha theihna siangtak len chinten in, Mi khenkhatte’n huai sialehpha theihna paikhia in ginna lam ah long sia bang in a kekseta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaite lak ah Himenaia leh Alexander a pang uhi; Pathian a gensiat louhna ding un amaute Setan ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in a masapen in thilnget thumnate, thumna himhimte, thumsaknate, kipahthu gennate, mi tengteng ading a bawlsak ding in k’on hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipate leh thuneite tengteng ading in leng; Pathian limsak leh zahtakhuaitaka kituaka khamuanga i om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai tuh i Hondampa Pathian theih in a hoih in, a kipahhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman mi tengteng hotdam a om ding leh thutak thei ding in a deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pathian khat kia a om, Pathian leh mihing kikal ah Palai khat kia a om nawn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah mihing ahi, Khrist Jesu, mi tengteng tatna dia kipepa pen.” Huai theihpihna a huntak a piak ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai hihding a tangkoupihpa ding leh sawltak a seh ka hi, Khrist ah thu taktak ka gen, ka zuau kei; ginna leh thutak a Jentelte hilhpa a seh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasalte’n munchih a khut siangthou zak in, thangpai lou leh ginglel lou in thum le uh ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua bangmah in numeite zumthei leh omdan siam in puansilh kilawm lel in kivan le uh; samphek, dangkaeng, tuikepsuang leh, puan mantam taktakte a kivanlou in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh numei Pathian limsak kichite a kihun lel in thilhih hoih in kivan le uh ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei in thumang hiathiat in om dinden in zil hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh numei in thu a hilhzaw ka phalkei, pasal tung a thuneih leng ka phal sam kei, dai dinden in omzaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adam siam masak ahi a, huai nung in Evi siam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam khem in a omkei a, numei khem in a om a, tatlekna ah a pukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Numei in omdan siamna toh ginna leh itna leh siangthouna a a om gige leh nau pianna ah hotdam in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kuapeuh saptuam heutu apan ut in nasep hoih a ut ahi, chih a dik ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in saptuam heutu tuh gensiatbei, zi khat nei, kidek thei, navak tak, mi diktat, mi paktakdan siam, thuhilhsiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />uain khamhatlou, mivuak hatlou mi nunnem a hi ding hi, selhatlou, sum deihta lou,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />zahtakhuai tak a tate kemsiam, amah inn sung kizentak a vaihawm siam mi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Min amah inn sung vaihawm nangawn kizentak a a hihsiam kei leh bangchi’n ahia Pathian saptuam a kep theih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gingthakmi ahi ding ahi kei, huchilou in zaw a kisathei kha dia, Diabol siamlouh tansakna ah a pukkha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaite lou leng pawlam a mite phat in a om nalai ding ahi, huchilou in zaw gensiat a a om in Diabol thang ah a awk kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchibang in saptuam Upa mi zahtakhuai ahi ding uh ahi; kamtamte, uain haite, lepna nin a huaiham mite ahi ding ahi kei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />sialehpha theihna siang a ginna a thuguk kemmi ahizaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan huaite leng chet in om masa uhen, huai nung in gensiatbei a hong hih uleh saptuam Upa na sem uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchibang in a numeite uh leng mi zahtakhuai ahi ding uhi, gensiat hatlou, kidekthei leh bangkim a muanhuai ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saptuam Upa zi khat nei a tate uleh amau inn sung vaihawm navaktaka hihmi hi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saptuam Upa na hoihtak a semte’n amau ading in phattak hihna a loh ua, huan Khrist Jesu a om ginna a muanna leh hangsanna thupitak a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawtlouchik chiang a na kiang a hongpai lamen in hiai thu na kiang ah ka gelh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh ka hongom sawt khak leh Pathian inkuanpihte lak a mi bangchibang in ahia a om ding uh chih na theihna ding in ka gelh ahi; Pathian inkuanpihte Pathian hing saptuamte, thutak khuam leh kingakna ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian biakna thuguk nial vuallouh in a thupi hi: “Pathian sa a muhtheih a latsak in a om a, Kha a siamtansak, Angelte muh, namte lak a tangkoupih, khovel a mite gintak, thupina a pitouh ahi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh tunung chiang in mi khenkhatte’n; pimangna khate leh dawite thuhilhna limsak in, ginna a hon tawpsan ding uh chih Kha in kichiantak in a gen hi: huai tuh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi zuautheite lepchiahna ziak in ahi; huai mi zuautheite amau sialehpha theihna ngei a sikam a halkeu bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kiten a kham ua, nekding ante, thutak thei a gingta te’n kipahthugena sandinga Pathian in a siamte, neklouh ding a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian thilsiam chiteng a hoih ngal a, kipahthugen a san a hihkhit phot leh bangmah deihlouh ding ahi kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thu leh thumna a hih siangthou ahi khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaite unaute na theihsak leh Khrist Jesu nasempa hoihtak, ginna leh thuhilhna hoih tutan a na zuih thu a vaklian na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian zahlouhna leh tangthu bulbal neiloute deih ken. Pathian limsak ding in kithuzoh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sapum kithuzohna a phatuam zeka; Pathian limsakna pen tangtawn in, tua omsa hinna leh hongom nawn ding piak chiamna a neih ziak in thil tengteng ah a phatuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai thu a muanhuai in a laktuak mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian hing i muan ziak in i semgim ua, i pang teitei uhi; amah mi tengteng Hondampa ahi a, a gingtate Hondampa ahi tuanse hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai thute pia inla, thuhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na naupanna kuamah musit sak ken; thugen ah, tatdan ah, itna ah, kha ah, ginna leh siangthouna ah, gingtute zuih ding hizaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hongpai masiah laisim, hanthawn leh thugin, limsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang maha om thilpiak thugenkholhna a piak, upate khut ngak a Pathian in nang a hon neihsak limsaklou ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tengteng kiang a na phattuamna a lat theihna ding in huai thilte ah thanuam inla, kizang zou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmah leh na thuhilh ah pilvang in; huai thilte hih in om gige in; huchibang hih in nangmah leh na thuzate na hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa deuhte tai kenla, pa bang in thuhilh in; tangval deuhte unaupa bang in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />pitek deuhte nu bang in; nungak deuhte siangthoutakin sanggamnu bang in thuhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meithai, meithai taktakte zahtak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh meithai kuapeuh in tate leh tute a neih uh leh, huaite’n amau inn sung ah Pathian limsakna mohpuakna thei masa uhenla, amau nu leh pate uh kem uhen; huai Pathian kipahlamtak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meithai taktak amah kia a om in Pathian tung ah lametna a nei a, sun leh zana ngen in a thum gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh meithai amah nopna lel a kipia zaw, a damlai nangawn in a si ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gensiatbeia a omtheihna ding un huaite thupiak in pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh kuapeuh in amah mite ading a ngaihtuah sakkei a, a ma inkuante kholhouh a ngaihtuahsak kei leh, ginna a zuausana, gingloumi sang in a gilou zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meithai kum sawmguk chiang nuailam hilou, mi khat zi hisa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil hoih hihlama mi phatlohta a tate vaktei khina, mikhualte na zintun khina, misiangthoute khe na silta a, mangbangte na dawnzang khina, thil hoih peuhmah thanuamtak a na hihkhin ahihleh meithai a gelh theih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh meithai naupang simte zaw gelh ken; Khrist lam a a hong kiplouh un pasal neih a ut nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ginna masa uh a topsan ziak un siamlouh tang in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huailou leng thadah in inn teng ah a banpawt nak uhi. Thadah kia leng hilou in, thu genlouh ding gen in, kamtam leh mite thilhih lai a vaihawmsak nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in meithai naupang simte zaw pasal nei in, tate nei uhenla, inn sung khosak ngaihtuah le uh, melmapa gensiatna ding lemtang musak kei le uh ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Meithai khenkhat setan lam naih in a pialkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gingtami numei hiam pasal hiam in methaite neita leh dawnzang hen; saptuamte hihbuai in omkei hen; meithai taktakte a dawnzang theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saptuam Upa vaihawm hoihte, abikin Thugin leh Thu a semgimte a lehnih a hihthupi tuak a seh nawnsem hi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Laisiangthou in, “Bawngtal in buh a chil lai in a muk gak ken,” a chi hi. “Nasemmi loh mutak ahi” a chi nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saptuam Upa hekna zaw theihpih nih hiam thum hiam kam a louzaw sang ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mikhialte mi tengteng ma ah taihilh in, midangte’n leng a lau theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Deihsaktuam leh khentuam nei a bangmah hihlou a hiai thute zui ding in Pathian leh Khrist Jesu leh angel teltuamte mitmuh in phatuamngaitak in k’on theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kuamah tung ah khutnga pah kenla, midang khelhna ah leng kikum ken; ki hihsiangthou gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tui kia dawn kenla, na gilpi ziak in leh na hatlouh nak ziak in uain neu khakha zang zel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi khenkhatte khelhna a lang gige a, vaihawmna a tun nak hi; mi khenkhat khelhnate bel a khonungin a hong kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in mi khenkhatte thil hoih hih kilang pah a om a, a kilang loute leng seltheih ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian min leh a thuhilhna thu gensiat a a omlouhna ding in sikha hakkol bat peuhmah te’n amau pute bangkim ah zahtak tham in sim uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan gingta mi pu a neite’n unau a hih ziak un ngaineu kei uhen, himahleh phattuamna mute leh deihtakte a hih ziak un a na uh sepsak semsem uhen. Huai thute hilh inla, hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi kuapeuh in thuhilhna dang a hilh a, thutak, I Toupa Jesu Khrist thu, leh Pathian limsak lam thuhilhna hoih a sakkei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah kisathei ahi, bangmah theilou ahi, theih naksang in kisel leh thukalh lam ah a hai zawta a, huchibang a kipan in, enna, kilaina, gensiatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hoihlou lam a ginna, selhatna a suak nak hi; huchibang selhat mite lungsim sia nei leh thutak neilou mi, Pathian limsak pen punna khattou sa mi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungkimna toh kithuah Pathian limsakna punna thupitak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khovel ah bangmah i lutpih kei a, bangmah i pawtpih thei sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh nekding leh silhding nei in, huaite ah i lungkim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh, hauhsak tumte khemna, thang, haihuai leh hihsethei duhgawlna tampi ah a puklut nak uhi, huaite’n tuh siatna leh manthatna ah mite a hihtum nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dangka sum deihtak zaw gilou chiteng bul ahi; khenkhatte’n a eng ua, ginna a paimangsan ua, amau leh amau lungkhamna tampi in a ki sunlet tektok uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh nang Pathian mipa aw, huai thilte taisan inla, diktatna, Pathian limsakna, ginna, itna, thuaktheihna, kingaihniamnate delh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ginna kidouna hoih sual inla, tangtawn hinna len chinten in; huai tang ding a sap na hi hi; theihpih tamtakte mitmuh in gupna hoih na gumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian thilbangkim hihhingpa leh Khrist Jesu, Pontia Pilat mai a gupna hoih gumpa mitmuh in thu ka honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Khrist hong kilatnawn masiah huai thupiak siangthou leh gensiatbeia kem ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai kilakna amah huntak ah phattuak thuneipa tak kia, kumpipate Kumpipa, toupate Toupa’n a lak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah kia in sihtheihlouhna a nei a, vak naihtheih vuallouh ah a om a, amah kuamah in a mu ngeikei ua, muh leng a mu thei sam kei uhi; amah kiang ah tangtawn in thupina leh thilhihtheihna om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai khovel a mihausate kisatheilou ding leh sum muanhuailou a muanna ngalou a, thil tengteng kipahna ding a tampi a hon pepa Pathian a nga zaw ding in hilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil hoih a hih ding uh, thil hoih hih a a hauh ding uh, thilphala a siam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi a amau ading a gou kikhola, tunung a ding a suangphum hoih phuma, tangtawn hinna taktak a letkip theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Timothi aw, na kiang a kepsaka om kem hoih in; Pathian zahlouh thugen mawkmawk leh kikalhna dikloupi a pilna kichite nungngatsan in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khenkhat in huai nei kichi in ginna ah a paikhial uhi. Hehpihna na kiang ah om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
